        "K3 checker.hc done — 15 tests green, three-source self-check clean",
        "K4 interp.hc done — 10/10 corpus stdout parity, cargo gate 10 passed",
        "K5–K6 (bootstrap closure / reproducible build) pending",
        "Rust reference kept as parity oracle"
      ]
    },
